# Line endings are part of this project's correctness, not a style preference.
#
# `npm run match` compares contracts/unison.py byte for byte against what
# is deployed on chain. With git left to its own devices that comparison is
# platform dependent: core.autocrlf rewrites the file to CRLF on a Windows
# checkout and LF everywhere else, so the same commit produces two different
# digests and the check that is supposed to prove "the deployed bytes are the
# source" fails for half the people who run it.
#
# Everything is therefore stored and checked out with LF, on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Fonts are binary and must never be touched.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
